WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Doctor,

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
have you performed subcision?

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Yes, we are performing subcision.

4
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.500
I am quite critical when it comes to subcision.

5
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Many people say they had one session
and did not improve.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.500
The truth is that subcision without
filler injection makes no sense.

7
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.500
It is ineffective!

8
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.500
But most of the time,
its effect is the opposite.

9
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
During subcision, we must also

10
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.500
inject a monophasic filler,

11
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.500
so that the two tissues that were attached,

12
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.200
and that we separated with subcision,

13
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.000
can heal separately,
with a space between them.

14
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.500
Without filler injection,

15
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.500
the patient's condition will
definitely, definitely get worse.

16
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.700
Proper subcision is one session.
